        "subtitle": "<div>If you have ever looked through ATI or HESI exit practice, you start to notice a certain rhythm in the way they ask questions. They push you into clinical thinking the same way your instructors did on those days where everything suddenly felt very real. This section breaks down the two question types that show up almost everywhere on the ATI Exit and HESI Exit exams, the ones that quietly determine how prepared you truly are for practice.</div>",
